<urn:usf:cli-contract:artifact:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Each artifact binds schema IRI/version, producer transition identity, repository/profile/work basis identity, digest domain and authenticating reader ID. Authenticating means independent current authority and original source/receipt chain, not self-consistent serialized JSON hashes. Historical lineage remains immutable and distinct from current completion/currentness observations." <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
