<urn:usf:cli-contract:input:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Closed structured fields specify name, position or option, type, requiredness, cardinality, bounds and exclusive groups. Canonical whole path includes nested leaves and option-selected modes; prose synopsis and top-level command names are not a coverage denominator. Unknown, duplicate, ambiguous or unsupported options refuse before effect selection." <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
