<urn:usf:requirement:cli-transition-definition> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Require actual confined tests of canonical whole-path interrogation, graph-derived DAG and exact leaf ownership, explicit unmapped coverage, malformed and ambiguous graph refusal, immutable discovery, authenticated readback boundaries and no arbitrary imports. Completion requires integrated exact postimages and current ordinary no-change checked evidence/proof/publication readback; no lifecycle or provider claim." <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
