<urn:usf:rule:cli-transition-adapter:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "src/graph/cli-transitions.ts must not import src/commands or CLI modules. Graph projection consumes pure typed inventory and adapter contract data supplied by the command layer; executable adapter lookup and invocation remain in that layer. Preserve repository architecture rules." <urn:usf:graph:cli-transition-definition> .
